            <div xml:id="m-35e1cb30-2753-43e7-a2d8-bd8c7c53edea">
              <lg xml:id="m-2d704882-b872-42a6-8cab-cf52f6eec763">
                <l xml:id="m-508492e1-0865-4e02-9d08-b197c9bf6682" facs="#m-c0c187a8-10d4-405e-bdb1-579c8ecc8203" label="text-like">Saturdays in honour of the B. V. M. Mass I. 1269</l><l xml:id="m-68c391c1-ece1-410c-a49f-11c0b9fa57e4" facs="#m-e5c1bf03-8c69-47f1-bb21-e770e91b6ba1" label="text-like">MASSES OF THE B. V. M. ON SATURDAYS.</l><l xml:id="m-a6f11b1e-7da4-43c2-bf07-f292340d3a08" facs="#m-3a862422-2345-4206-a6d6-da194283b393" label="ambiguous">I. IN ADVENT.</l><l xml:id="m-76ce5ca7-c93a-4ca2-a351-66ce7c1e281a" facs="#m-f22b10bd-3ed4-40b8-83fa-731069f71955" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-aa0ecb5a-4606-46a2-a090-f8468ed3b728" facs="#m-32c621f2-9e40-462f-91a8-340c31a4b419" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-660091a9-525e-4408-96df-935a49b2b192" facs="#m-cdadaa1d-6eec-4cdf-bf16-4f08178ee5b4" label="lyrics-like">RO-râ-te“ caé-li dé-su- per, et nú-bes plú¬ ant</l><l xml:id="m-84aa06c5-7121-4676-aed2-92a7c487bf3b" facs="#m-0f03ee42-532a-41f7-a715-ad022ddb7fc6" label="lyrics-like">jú- stum : ape-ri-á-tur tér- ra, et gérminet Salva¬</l><l xml:id="m-8773af1c-1b2a-4a0a-94b6-432046984873" facs="#m-83c57be6-a97c-44ad-8173-4cf4dc77d45d" label="lyrics-like">tó-rem. Ps. Benedixísti Dómine térram tú-am: * a-vertí¬</l><l xml:id="m-13ea821b-7e3d-4012-b408-93a39cc0d568" facs="#m-2a15ffd6-23df-477f-aaa7-74ee186df093" label="lyrics-like">sti capti-vi-tátem Já- cob. Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u ou a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-ca92ae67-5580-4569-97e2-656290b1432f" facs="#m-24f1be93-1193-42d5-967b-93e7216e05da" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-9e3a33b4-d24b-4166-aa5e-2ca7f7be0bad" facs="#m-bc947432-a7c4-4224-bae6-fb8981b23a25" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui de beátae Maríae Vir-lut, qui vere eam Genitricem Dei</l><l xml:id="m-76293336-7057-4de6-8753-c45939386e81" facs="#m-905a9958-aca6-4206-a656-361e8615ad47" label="lyrics-like">crédimus, ejus apud te intercessió¬</l><l xml:id="m-2cac9000-6eee-4ed3-9890-e466b6ee161f" facs="#m-ac9bd515-bbfa-43f3-b645-baf5aad410d7" label="lyrics-like">Uginis útero, Verbum tuum, An¬</l><l xml:id="m-f31220b7-cd5e-4c87-82e3-bfa79f0bd167" facs="#m-8491c2e9-a550-4b11-892c-f7104d549ab7" label="lyrics-like">gelo nuntiánte, carnem suscípere</l><l xml:id="m-73e98e74-7176-4ae8-807f-bcdaea9e2bd8" facs="#m-a124da40-75cf-41ba-9372-e54eaf430146" label="lyrics-like">nibus adjuvémur. Per eúmdem Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0c1a18a-6ddc-4da4-9b17-fa482e2bd3d4" facs="#m-fdf8b180-fdd3-488b-9e1a-a1a89fe08ea5" label="lyrics-like">voluísti: praesta supplícibus tuis; minum.</l><l xml:id="m-3d71e21d-1482-4d9a-8723-44deb9b82d7e" facs="#m-4fe76bc3-69f1-4af8-ba63-fda580bbbb45" label="text-like">Lectio Isaiae Prophetae. Is. 7. b.</l><l xml:id="m-0ac8ce25-068c-4a64-a0c3-37485830837d" facs="#m-50572419-353e-411e-93bc-fd6bd7b40c34" label="lyrics-like">IN diébus illis: Locútus est Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1009e6f4-316e-44e9-87d1-cd8eae384a3b" facs="#m-37d46182-001f-4ee7-be3d-a6934e248e67" label="lyrics-like">homínibus, quia molésti estis et</l><l xml:id="m-5a12e745-1560-4d6e-a324-e6be5eb4de5c" facs="#m-5d4e12af-83bb-4ab8-88a6-6718ea53afb8" label="lyrics-like">Deo meo? Propter hoc dabit Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c550e54-4357-404f-8e21-95a54319491f" facs="#m-18d8910b-35d5-4526-856a-b75a4d241e9f" label="ambiguous">L nus ad Achaz, dicens: Pete tibi</l><l xml:id="m-e658ec21-1043-4f4d-8084-5f9a28a07347" facs="#m-b5e32dce-414b-4cfb-ab6e-74bf4e2bce2d" label="lyrics-like">signum a Dómino Deo tuo in pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b21386a-1817-47d3-bc2d-fe5e4e9f9d2d" facs="#m-d187dbf4-ce33-4f6f-90d6-6ded0f702dc8" label="ambiguous">minus ipse vobis signum. Ecce virgo</l><l xml:id="m-95eccf21-10bc-4f1c-9eaf-4a5166f303be" facs="#m-b183bd65-26ab-43a5-9f28-3e1c848645d4" label="lyrics-like">fúndum inférni, sive in excélsum</l><l xml:id="m-2f9a044a-edf6-4b84-aa49-a9e8316cef97" facs="#m-d5a340ce-99da-4f36-af5d-41d1393ea376" label="lyrics-like">concipiet, et páriet filium, et vocá¬</l><l xml:id="m-589a8ab2-7340-4a4c-a8c1-651f8ab1da33" facs="#m-17abfd9a-7483-459d-8704-15aaf46dfa97" label="ambiguous">supra. Et dixit Achaz: Non petam,</l><l xml:id="m-db521a5e-7e79-481d-a395-bd262425d824" facs="#m-18ff0bd1-8c91-4dfc-9e0a-9a8520b65d1f" label="lyrics-like">bitur nomen ejus Emmánuel. Buty¬</l><l xml:id="m-94c43aff-e9a9-4347-b483-ecc2ec9656a6" facs="#m-b98e859f-5a7c-452a-accc-439561083a95" label="lyrics-like">et non tentábo Dóminum. Et dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-42f4cd95-2304-4f07-9ada-37e5eb207fde" facs="#m-5874fa0a-144e-4905-baf6-4be1f9da9b4e" label="lyrics-like">rum et mel cómedet, ut sciat repro¬</l><l xml:id="m-b81be31e-aebd-4130-b923-28004447d5b2" facs="#m-c06cb631-f960-4316-9e10-e8e3a614a186" label="ambiguous">Audite ergo, domus David : Num¬</l><l xml:id="m-4f18747b-2495-4bd4-b4f7-847439be9574" facs="#m-c8075c7d-90b6-46e9-af2b-357e48d2fe1c" label="lyrics-like">báre malum, et eligere bonum.</l><l xml:id="m-cca390b3-fa83-4c10-ab34-51b27c4a29a1" facs="#m-20410dfe-f288-4f01-834e-4375d908e522" label="lyrics-like">quid parum vobis est, moléstos esse</l><l xml:id="m-1eafe678-a257-409a-9f69-53d4345ec294" facs="#m-b5766989-8060-4d79-94f3-31c69802fe82" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-aef557e0-6c98-4a03-a3e8-067cf12ae8c6" facs="#m-2dd334f1-0723-4e01-b637-4e51c35a1cef" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-eae70df2-b145-4e79-b60b-6d96c5b9a0bd" facs="#m-c3b6e42e-5847-449d-94f0-619f4e3ad467" label="ambiguous">T</l><l xml:id="m-f659f9a0-d945-4c35-b9de-6937f48872c7" facs="#m-78f40b0a-7e67-4439-bef7-4403782126ce" label="lyrics-like">Ol-li-te “ pór¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe9a9e77-1ed5-40c7-b937-635c8cd4a769" facs="#m-00a95da8-a388-4a83-822d-b94d0ddc500c" label="lyrics-like">tas, prín-ci- pes,</l><l xml:id="m-c233345e-63b1-4f73-8583-0b374708309c" facs="#m-bf614c1a-02e4-4b67-959a-eb20894386a0" label="lyrics-like">vé¬</l><l xml:id="m-c1879857-487f-40fb-bf7b-d6e85e393cc7" facs="#m-51fdff27-2521-4cb5-8575-72973edea453" label="lyrics-like">et e-levá¬ mi-ni, pór- tae ae- ter¬</l><l xml:id="m-76ff1819-255a-4da4-81b3-a190b8daba10" facs="#m-de28cdfd-29b4-4eba-8a85-5f9edfeda194" label="ambiguous">stras:</l><l xml:id="m-eaad01a2-9065-44de-88dc-3ce64984bc5b" facs="#m-694dc9dc-63c0-416e-9caf-32055df11426" label="ambiguous">bit</l><l xml:id="m-5d60c1f3-d874-4305-b652-bccf3362a3a1" facs="#m-09c56741-74c5-4c98-9908-3f8f3c6a18ad" label="ambiguous">et intro-i¬</l><l xml:id="m-8824b68c-6668-493a-8491-6d30aea3df0d" facs="#m-b31e0017-e0e4-4b80-90b2-cd892235bf7c" label="ambiguous">les:</l><l xml:id="m-58d16f29-32ff-4c73-a617-f452bf54d444" facs="#m-4f4df488-b7f0-443f-a16a-8db2557d3ad8" label="lyrics-like">ná¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
